{"id":1050402,"chapter_id":1050402,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<i>「南西の大地は荒れ果てており、荒れた山と枯れた木しかない」</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"アイティ","content":"荒野を越えたその向こうには何があるのかな？","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"<i>「魔法使いアイティは枯れた大樹に登り、遠くを見渡す」</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"アイティ","content":"えっ？木なんかないけど……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"アイティが周囲を見渡すと、屋外エリアの街灯が目に留まった。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"彼女はあなたを一瞥して、素早い動きで街灯に登る。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"……コホン。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"<i>「遠くを見渡すと、魔法使いアイティは大きな集落を見つけた。そこに行けば、何かの情報が手に入れるかもしれない。</i>","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"アイティ","content":"でも今は何も持っていないから、簡単には荒野を渡れないわね……","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"アイティ","content":"じゃあ、まずは周りの環境を観察してみるわ。","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"あなたはダイスを取り出して、しゃがんでダイスを振った。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"アイティ","content":"クリティカル！さすがアタシ～！","voice":["vo_trial_50402_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150402012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"<i>「魔法使いアイティが周りの環境をよく観察す